{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんと喧嘩しちゃった。\n私が悪いんだ。\nあやねちゃんを信じてあげなかったから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(※乃木恋の中での話です。笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということでじょしらくゲネプロ\n観てきました～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が観たのはチームら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年から更にパワーアップしてて\nとっても面白かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんもとっても可愛く\nキグちゃんになりきれていて\n成長を感じた母でした！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のチームも見たいなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、EX大衆発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアルバムのお話も兼ねて\n乃木坂の楽曲について\nいろいろお話しさせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は名曲だらけだけど\n日陰の曲というか...\nいい曲ということが\nあまり知られていない曲が\nたくさんあるので、\n一曲一曲時間をかけて育てていけたら\nいいなあと思っています！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして付録には乃木恋クリアファイルが\nついています～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員が載ったファイル\n豪華特典すぎる！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファイルをゲットして、\n是非使ってくださいね～～(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ひらがな欅のメンバー決まったみたいだね。\nもうチェックした?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろんチェック済み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わりと年齢が近い子が居て\n親近感(^o^)(^o^)(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会ってみたいなあ～～！\nでもその前に私は\n欅ちゃんと写メを撮りたい！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日放送の乃木のので\n二期生曲「かき氷の片想い」が\n初解禁されます～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会中だけど、是非是非\n聴いていただきたいです～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいい曲です！\nハードルどんどんあげます！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/14/2627153/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は初めての握手会3部制。。。\n過疎過疎なんじゃないかと\n不安ではありますが\n楽しみましょう～～(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}